The '''Dark Auction''' is an event which occurs every {{Green|3}} [[Time Systems|SkyBlock Days]], or every real-life hour. During this event, exclusive items are sold to the highest bidder.

== Mechanics ==
The '''Dark Auction''' occurs every {{Green|3}} SkyBlock days at midnight, usually occurring at the 55-minute mark of every hour. {{NPCSprite|Sirius}} will appear: players with a minimum of {{c|400k}} in the purse will be eligible to enter. Only the richest players will be allowed to enter the '''Dark Auction'''.

Items in the '''Dark Auction''' will be presented for {{Green|5s}} before players can place bids on them, after which players will have {{Green|10s}} to place their bids: however, the timer is reset every time a bid is placed. Players can only place predetermined amounts of {{c}}: all non-winning bids are refunded. Players who place the highest bid but disconnect before claiming it will have the coins automatically deducted and the item sent to {{NPCSprite|Jerry}}'s [[Lost & Found]]. {{Green|5}} items appear every '''Dark Auction''', with the number increasing to {{Green|8}} while {{NPCSprite|Scorpius}} is mayor.

If no one places any bids on an item, the auction will end with no winner and this message will appear:<ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/HypixelSkyblock/comments/1qyv1b2/in_my_dark_auction_lobby_nobody_bid_on_the_book_xd/</ref> {{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &6Sirius&f: No one made any bids! Let's move on to the next item.}}

If it was the last item, the message will instead say: {{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &6Sirius&f: No one made any bids!}}

== Auctioned Items ==
Items can only appear in certain positions of the Dark Auction's order. The auctioned items will be randomly selected from the possible items available from that round.

Each item may only appear once: items that appear cannot appear in any following rounds.
