== Trivia ==
The {{Item|Personal Bank}}, [[Bazaar]], and [[Auction House]] cannot be accessed while inside the '''Dark Auction'''.
* Once the player has been in the '''Dark Auction''' once, the days of which the Dark Auction takes place will appear on their [[Calendar]]. The player will also receive {{Coins|1000}}.
* Participating in a full '''Dark Auction''' for the first time will award the {{Ach|Sirius Business}} achievement.
* The music played in the '''Dark Auction''' is ''C418 - Stal''.
* During the [[Resistance Movement]] event, the '''Dark Auction''' functioned as a base for [[Resistance Movement|The Resistance]]. Here, players could elect on the [[Resistance Leader]] and [[Resistance General]]s.

